### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@pseudonymousId = 0b6a5c1e-2b0f-4f0b-9d54-5f7a6c1f0099
@deviceToken = replace-with-token-from-register
@adminJwt = replace-with-jwt-from-login
@demoBoardId = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000ff
@indeedId = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Register pseudonymous device (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudonymousId": "{{pseudonymousId}}"
}

### 3. Whitelist & approved selectors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registry/whitelist

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registry/selectors?since=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z

### 4. Bootstrap dictionaries, skill autocomplete & hotwords
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dictionaries/bootstrap

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills?q=java

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/hotwords

### 5. Submit vacancy on permitted board (200 OK, stored full & sanitized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vacancies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: {{pseudonymousId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

{
  "platformId": "{{demoBoardId}}",
  "url": "https://demo-board.test/jobs/3001#details",
  "fullPositionName": "Senior Backend Engineer",
  "companyName": "Cloud Systems",
  "description": "Java 26, Spring Boot, PostgreSQL. Contact: Jane Doe at jane@example.com.",
  "salaryFrom": 4500,
  "salaryTo": 6500,
  "currencyId": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"
}

### 6. Submit vacancy on non-whitelisted board (200 OK, server forces url_only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vacancies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: {{pseudonymousId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

{
  "platformId": "{{indeedId}}",
  "url": "https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=xyz999",
  "fullPositionName": "Ignored on url_only board",
  "description": "Discarded by server policy"
}

### 7. List active vacancies (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vacancies?platformCode=demo-board.test&page=0&size=20&sort=updatedAt,desc

### 8. Submit selector proposal (201 Created) & invalid script edge case (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/selectors
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: {{pseudonymousId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

{
  "platformId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "taskId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "elementTypeId": "30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "urlPattern": "weworkremotely.com",
  "kind": "css",
  "selectorString": "span.title, h3.new-title"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/selectors
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: {{pseudonymousId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

{
  "platformId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "taskId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "elementTypeId": "30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "kind": "css",
  "selectorString": "javascript:alert(1)"
}

### 9. Anonymous GDPR Art. 17 removal request (202 Accepted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/removal-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUrl": "https://demo-board.test/jobs/3001",
  "note": "GDPR Art. 17 request"
}

### 10. ClickHouse OLAP analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/skills-demand

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/salary-by-country

### 11. Admin login (never pass X-Device-Id on /api/admin/**)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "replace-with-admin-password"
}

### 12. Admin selector queue & manual ETL trigger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/selectors/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/etl/run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}
